<h1>Best AI Tools for Marketers 2026</h1>
<p><em>Last updated: November 18, 2026 · Last verified: November 18, 2026 — pricing checked against each vendor's official pricing page</em></p>

<p>Marketing work in 2026 splits into five recurring jobs: research, written content, visual and video assets, distribution, and the automation that ties them together. Each job now has dedicated AI tooling, and each one bills in a different unit — seats, credits, documents, generated minutes — which is why two teams of the same size can end up with bills that differ by a factor of five.</p>

<p>This guide covers the nine tools we see most often in a working marketing stack. Every price was checked against the vendor's own pricing page on 18 November 2026, and where a plan is credit- or document-based we have given the conversion the vendor publishes rather than a guess.</p>

